  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Magnetic moment is directly proportional to the number of unpaired in the central metal atom&nbsp;of a complex.</p><p>It is calculated by the formula,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></msqrt><mi>BM</mi></math></p><p>(A)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi>FeF</mi><mn>6</mn></msub></mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mn>4</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>0</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p>(B)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Fe</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>CN</mi></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/04627242-343e-4dcd-9292-6947c756fcb9-image.png\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 94px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mn>4</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>0</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>(C)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi>MnCl</mi><mn>6</mn></msub></mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/166f1f71-9c4d-407a-8b9e-3af526584d61-image.png\" style=\"width: 140px; height: 100px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Mn</mi><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mn>4</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>0</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>(D)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Mn</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>CN</mi></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/579613fb-9b3e-47ed-aae7-ad64d4fc34ac-image.png\" style=\"width: 120px; height: 73px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Mn</mi><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mn>4</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>0</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Hence</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>correct</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>order</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>of</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>magnetic</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>moment</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>is</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math></p>",
